      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          151
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          145
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-09-p151.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（一） · 实战精刷9 · 讲义第145页",
            "pdfPage": 151
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-09-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s14-t03-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先按原图找两条平行边：AD与BC平行，长度分别200、100；AB是斜边260，不能把AB当梯形高。两条平行边的距离为√（260²−100²）=240米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "梯形总面积（200+100）×240÷2=36000。阴影△ABQ之外是△ADQ与△BCQ：DQ=100，QC=240−100=140，所以两块面积分别10000与7000。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "S_{ABQ}=\\frac{200+100}{2}\\times240-\\frac12\\times200\\times100-\\frac12\\times100\\times140=19000"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所求为36000−10000−7000=19000平方米，我们选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
